      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ponderosa%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2020, the Sequoia Complex Fire spared Ponderosa while nearby towns burned, preserving its historic character.",
